compiz-plugin-staticdock (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add per-effect (Cube/Rotate and Expo) options to enable or
    disable static docks.
  * Add a generic option to enable static windows for other
    transformed-screen effects (e.g. eZoom).

 -- Roberto Metere <roberto@metere.it>  Tue, 04 Aug 2026 09:14:00 +0100

compiz-plugin-staticdock (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: standalone out-of-tree compiz plugin that keeps
    dock/panel windows flat and fully opaque while cube, rotate, or
    expo transform the desktop.

 -- Roberto Metere <roberto@metere.it>  Sat, 01 Aug 2026 10:22:45 +0000
